1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,080
Cinderella

2
00:00:06,180 --> 00:00:11,380
Cinderella's Sister

3
00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:19,280
Cinderella's Sister

4
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:22,500
Episode 19

5
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,610
How far are you going to go?

6
00:00:24,610 --> 00:00:29,330
No matter where we go, we don't need that stuff. It'll just be me and you.

7
00:00:29,330 --> 00:00:33,060
Let's just pretend that stuff doesn't exist for a bit, okay?

8
00:00:34,950 --> 00:00:36,470
Don't go too far.

9
00:00:36,470 --> 00:00:40,790
Keep your mouth shut. Don't even let out a peep.

10
00:00:40,790 --> 00:00:44,050
Eun Jo will keep her mouth closed.

11
00:00:45,740 --> 00:00:51,150
Do you know that I'm hungry?

12
00:00:52,520 --> 00:00:54,960
I haven't eaten a single meal since I got taken away.

13
00:00:54,960 --> 00:00:56,420
Not even one meal?

14
00:00:56,420 --> 00:01:01,530
I was afraid of getting poisoned. How could I have eaten? I was too scared.

15
00:01:05,240 --> 00:01:10,120
I don't know why I feel hungry whenever I see your face.

16
00:01:10,120 --> 00:01:12,300
Look straight ahead. Instead of smiling.

17
00:01:14,580 --> 00:01:18,830
I'm not smiling because I plan to eat your flesh, so don't worry.

18
00:01:18,830 --> 00:01:20,060
What?

19
00:01:20,060 --> 00:01:24,690
You look like skin and bones, so what would I eat?

20
00:01:28,390 --> 00:01:30,910
You still can laugh?

21
00:01:30,910 --> 00:01:32,480
Yes.

22
00:01:58,250 --> 00:02:01,230
There are no restaurants. How could you come to such a place?

23
00:02:01,230 --> 00:02:04,380
You didn't listen and just kept driving. You're hungry. What are we going to do?

24
00:02:04,380 --> 00:02:08,140
It's okay. Come here, let's talk for a while.

25
00:02:10,360 --> 00:02:12,360
Where are you going?

26
00:02:16,810 --> 00:02:18,770
Grandmother.

27
00:02:21,130 --> 00:02:23,180
Hi, Grandmother.

28
00:02:23,200 --> 00:02:27,070
I know this isn't a restaurant,

29
00:02:27,070 --> 00:02:30,130
but would you be able to give us something to eat?

30
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:36,920
There's nothing around here, and there's someone who hasn't eaten for days.

31
00:02:36,920 --> 00:02:41,710
If he suddenly eats just anything, he might get sick.

32
00:02:41,710 --> 00:02:45,600
Would you be able to please cook us some porridge?

33
00:02:45,600 --> 00:02:48,420
Just plain rice porridge would be fine.

34
00:02:49,210 --> 00:02:52,600
I'll pay you well for the meal.

35
00:03:15,110 --> 00:03:17,750
You little punk, remember this.

36
00:03:17,750 --> 00:03:20,950
I know what thoughts are going around in your head right now,

37
00:03:20,950 --> 00:03:24,300
but we agreed to pretend nothing happened for a bit.

38
00:03:24,300 --> 00:03:29,910
At this moment, we're back in time in the month of May, year 2002. Got it?

39
00:03:33,270 --> 00:03:38,050
Starting right now, for one hour and 20 minutes, every ten minutes is one year, got it?

40
00:03:39,920 --> 00:03:43,170
I have no idea what you're talking about.

41
00:03:43,170 --> 00:03:48,880
I didn't take the train, and I've been living with you at Dae Seong True Winemakers the whole time.

42
00:03:48,890 --> 00:03:51,360
Starting now!

43
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:54,830
Starting now, it'll be the year 2002 for ten minutes.

44
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:02,220
Eun Jo, you little punk.

45
00:04:02,240 --> 00:04:04,880
Problem number 10 on your Math homework. Why did you get it wrong?

46
00:04:04,880 --> 00:04:08,710
Didn't I show you a problem that was almost exactly the same?

47
00:04:08,710 --> 00:04:13,280
This won't do. You need to get your hands hit. Stretch out your hands.

48
00:04:15,940 --> 00:04:20,800
You won't? Do you find your teacher funny?

49
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:22,920
Just eat your porridge.

50
00:04:27,200 --> 00:04:28,860
Please.
(T/N: Adding a formal ending to her sentence instead of using informal speech.)

51
00:04:36,020 --> 00:04:40,270
You've been spending a lot of time with that music major these days.

52
00:04:40,270 --> 00:04:44,820
Who is that punk? Oh, you're smiling?

53
00:04:44,820 --> 00:04:47,840
You little... you're smiling? You smile instead of answering me?

54
00:04:47,840 --> 00:04:51,550
At 4:30 p.m., I was in the year 2005.

55
00:04:51,550 --> 00:04:56,310
I was a new student at the university this person was studying at after he returned to school.

56
00:04:56,310 --> 00:05:02,350
This person was my college senior, who helped me carry my bag everyday.
Last Stop Store

57
00:05:11,380 --> 00:05:17,470
Grandmother, can we leave our car with you as a guarantee and borrow your bicycle?

58
00:05:31,930 --> 00:05:36,310
Even though you're smart, you're doomed if you don't study.

59
00:05:36,310 --> 00:05:40,360
Do you know how picky your professor is?

60
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:44,750
4:40 p.m., it's the year 2006.

61
00:05:44,750 --> 00:05:49,590
After this person graduated, he postponed job hunting, and pursued postgraduate education.

62
00:05:49,590 --> 00:05:52,160
Because without him around school, he was afraid that I'd decide to start dating

63
00:05:52,160 --> 00:05:55,720
so he wanted to keep an eye on me.

64
00:05:55,720 --> 00:06:00,210
GPA? You call that a GPA? 3.8?

65
00:06:00,210 --> 00:06:02,620
Is that even a GPA?

66
00:06:02,620 --> 00:06:06,930
I've never considered anything under 4.0 a real GPA.

67
00:06:37,790 --> 00:06:42,180
Studying overseas? You think I'd let you go?

68
00:06:42,180 --> 00:06:44,710
I don't even let you go to another nearby neighborhood alone

69
00:06:44,710 --> 00:06:47,550
because I'm scared someone will snatch you away.

70
00:06:47,550 --> 00:06:50,200
What? You want to go to America to study?

71
00:06:50,200 --> 00:06:54,300
Until I graduate, just learn English from me for the time being.

72
00:06:54,300 --> 00:06:58,540
Repeat after me. "I am a boy."

73
00:07:03,490 --> 00:07:07,200
5:00 p.m., it's 2008.

74
00:07:07,200 --> 00:07:11,980
I've graduated from college. Even until now,

75
00:07:11,980 --> 00:07:15,990
this person and I haven't broken up once.

76
00:07:18,060 --> 00:07:21,340
Do you make sounds when you smile too?

77
00:07:25,910 --> 00:07:28,320
Smile one more time. Huh?

78
00:07:28,320 --> 00:07:29,800
What? Move aside.

79
00:07:29,800 --> 00:07:32,960
I told you to smile one more time. It's fascinating.

80
00:07:32,960 --> 00:07:34,530
It's all full now.

81
00:07:34,530 --> 00:07:36,560
Yes.

82
00:07:36,560 --> 00:07:39,750
Smile, you punk! While making a sound!

83
00:07:49,890 --> 00:07:53,240
Try looking around and see if you can find a guy like me.

84
00:07:53,240 --> 00:07:57,870
I'm handsome, intelligent, have ability, and a sense of humor.

85
00:07:58,870 --> 00:08:03,360
Although I don't have money, that can be earned in the future.

86
00:08:03,360 --> 00:08:07,890
There are so many married couples who start out with just two spoons and bowls.

87
00:08:09,220 --> 00:08:15,810
The one thing I feel sorry for is making you take care of my father right after we got married.

88
00:08:15,810 --> 00:08:19,280
After my father stepped down from the company,

89
00:08:19,280 --> 00:08:22,610
he completely became a toothless tiger.

90
00:08:23,730 --> 00:08:27,900
It's not bad. Control lies in our hands now.

91
00:08:29,180 --> 00:08:33,440
2010, 5:20 p.m.

92
00:08:33,440 --> 00:08:36,650
This person finally found a job.

93
00:08:36,650 --> 00:08:40,520
He didn't do anything wrong all this time,

94
00:08:40,520 --> 00:08:44,400
so he didn't feel any guilt inside at all.

95
00:08:44,400 --> 00:08:48,990
He proposed to me, without any burden.

96
00:08:48,990 --> 00:08:52,130
I didn't agree right away,

97
00:08:52,130 --> 00:08:58,190
I told him to give me some time to think, just to make things hard for him.

98
00:08:58,190 --> 00:09:02,600
Go and take it back. I'll start the car up.

99
00:09:02,600 --> 00:09:07,820
How do you expect to get married with nothing but a set of utensils?

100
00:09:07,820 --> 00:09:12,620
Let's think about it after we've saved up some money.

101
00:09:12,620 --> 00:09:16,030
Right now...not a chance.

102
00:09:32,790 --> 00:09:37,190
Thanks for lending it to us, Grandma. Thank you.

103
00:09:54,540 --> 00:10:00,300
♫ Leaving behind the time ♫

104
00:10:00,300 --> 00:10:04,680
♫ which was buried in my heart ♫

105
00:10:04,680 --> 00:10:11,390
Eun Jo. I know what kind of girl you are, that's why I'm doing this.

106
00:10:11,390 --> 00:10:15,220
I'm going to give these documents to Hong Joo Ga.

107
00:10:15,220 --> 00:10:19,560
If you don't want to give up Dae Seong True Winemakers, there's no other way.

108
00:10:19,600 --> 00:10:22,580
- Come back immediately.
- Go home.

109
00:10:22,580 --> 00:10:24,370
I'll take care of everything.

110
00:10:24,370 --> 00:10:26,010
I said come back right away!

111
00:10:26,010 --> 00:10:30,950
Eun Jo, listen to what I'm saying. Let's save the winery.

112
00:10:30,970 --> 00:10:33,510
Once we've saved the winery somehow,

113
00:10:33,510 --> 00:10:40,830
even if I become a beggar walking the streets barefoot, I would not care.

114
00:10:40,830 --> 00:10:43,540
Do you think I'll let you make that kind of a deal?

115
00:10:43,540 --> 00:10:46,350
Will doing this really ease your guilt?

116
00:10:46,350 --> 00:10:49,260
Are you that kind of person?

117
00:10:49,260 --> 00:10:52,850
I don't expect to ease my guilt.

118
00:10:52,850 --> 00:10:56,030
♫ Will you who knows everything about me ♫

119
00:10:56,030 --> 00:11:00,280
How could I ever be at ease?

120
00:11:00,280 --> 00:11:04,840
The fourth thing I haven't told you yet...

121
00:11:04,840 --> 00:11:09,750
I'll tell you after everything is over. Wait for me.

122
00:11:09,750 --> 00:11:13,300
Hello? Hello?!

123
00:11:13,300 --> 00:11:17,300
♫ The day I return to your side again ♫

124
00:11:17,300 --> 00:11:20,720
♫ will come again ♫

125
00:11:24,590 --> 00:11:27,210
Goo Hyo Seon

126
00:11:35,440 --> 00:11:37,250
Hello?

127
00:11:37,250 --> 00:11:40,310
Unni.

128
00:11:41,650 --> 00:11:45,060
Joon Soo has disappeared.

129
00:11:46,970 --> 00:11:48,460
What did you say?

130
00:11:48,460 --> 00:11:52,190
Joon Soo has disappeared.

131
00:11:52,190 --> 00:11:57,750
I went to find him because he was supposed to have come back from kindergarten already,

132
00:11:57,750 --> 00:12:01,540
but they said he had already left.

133
00:12:01,540 --> 00:12:05,670
I even tried contacting all of Joon Soo's friends,

134
00:12:05,670 --> 00:12:08,310
but they all said they didn't see him.

135
00:12:09,210 --> 00:12:13,140
I looked all over the neighborhood and the house...

136
00:12:14,780 --> 00:12:20,280
Unni, what should we do?

137
00:12:20,280 --> 00:12:24,970
Where are you? I'm scared to death...

138
00:12:24,970 --> 00:12:27,630
Hurry home.

139
00:12:35,560 --> 00:12:36,960
Hey kids, do you know where Joon Soo is?

140
00:12:36,960 --> 00:12:38,970
We don't know.

141
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:46,320
- Joon Soo!
- Child!

142
00:12:46,320 --> 00:12:50,470
Joon Soo!

143
00:12:50,470 --> 00:12:54,980
Joon Soo! Joon Soo!

144
00:12:54,980 --> 00:12:58,120
Child!

145
00:13:13,390 --> 00:13:16,830
Joon Soo. Joon Soo!

146
00:13:19,700 --> 00:13:22,010
Joon Soo!

147
00:13:36,960 --> 00:13:43,680
My fairy tale ended at 5:20.

148
00:14:19,740 --> 00:14:23,580
The recipient's phone is turned off, so you will be connected to voice mail.

149
00:14:23,580 --> 00:14:27,350
After you've been connected, the phone charges will begin.

150
00:14:36,820 --> 00:14:39,000
Mom.

151
00:14:55,600 --> 00:15:01,960
Stop crying and get up. Your mom will be in pain if she sees you like this.

152
00:15:01,960 --> 00:15:06,130
Ahjumma, I'm always so upset every day.

153
00:15:06,130 --> 00:15:09,640
I hate when the ajusshis make fun of my mom,

154
00:15:09,640 --> 00:15:13,970
and I also hate it when my mom smiles at the ajusshis.

155
00:15:13,970 --> 00:15:19,000
I hate it when Mom fights with the ajusshis too.

156
00:15:19,000 --> 00:15:22,860
I hate everything so much.

157
00:15:22,860 --> 00:15:26,930
Child, you think your mom does those things because she likes it?

158
00:15:26,930 --> 00:15:32,060
You think she goes around pouring wine and smiling because she likes it?

159
00:15:32,060 --> 00:15:34,910
She does it because she wants to feed and support you.

160
00:15:34,910 --> 00:15:40,120
Why are you hiding and crying all the time when you don't know the truth?

161
00:15:40,120 --> 00:15:44,810
- Hurry and get up.
- Ajumma, you don't even know anything!

162
00:15:44,810 --> 00:15:49,780
Do you know who the ajusshi my mom is drinking with is?

163
00:15:49,780 --> 00:15:52,840
He's my deskmate's father.

164
00:15:52,840 --> 00:15:56,930
She already hates me so much,

165
00:15:56,930 --> 00:16:00,030
and teases me a lot.

166
00:16:10,750 --> 00:16:14,460
You're really that upset?

167
00:16:16,010 --> 00:16:19,890
You're really upset?

168
00:16:27,070 --> 00:16:29,160
I'm sorry.

169
00:16:30,400 --> 00:16:36,790
Who would've known it would be this painful,

170
00:16:37,810 --> 00:16:43,820
and that a young child would shed so much blood and tears?

171
00:16:46,220 --> 00:16:51,550
I'm sorry.

172
00:17:09,640 --> 00:17:12,130
Joon Soo...

173
00:17:13,610 --> 00:17:17,110
What if something bad happened?

174
00:17:18,540 --> 00:17:23,140
No, that won't happen.

175
00:17:23,140 --> 00:17:28,170
Why are you thinking that? We'll find Joon Soo.

176
00:17:28,170 --> 00:17:32,310
We've reported it already, so the police will go out and help find him.

177
00:17:32,310 --> 00:17:36,160
We also haven't gone to all the houses of Joon Soo's friends yet.

178
00:17:40,040 --> 00:17:45,720
What's with you? Where have you been all day?

179
00:17:48,320 --> 00:17:50,670
I'll tell you later.

180
00:17:50,670 --> 00:17:54,650
- Right now, we should go find Joon Soo...
- I was pacing around the whole day.

181
00:17:54,650 --> 00:18:00,930
Even though I kneeled outside Halmoni's house, she wouldn't even take a look at me.

182
00:18:00,930 --> 00:18:05,820
No matter what I said, she wouldn't even listen.

183
00:18:07,180 --> 00:18:11,110
When I got back home, Joon Soo wasn't there.

184
00:18:11,110 --> 00:18:15,140
As time passed while I went to find him,

185
00:18:15,140 --> 00:18:19,400
I was so anxious that I couldn't take it anymore.

186
00:18:19,400 --> 00:18:22,080
Where were you? What were you doing?

187
00:18:22,080 --> 00:18:27,420
I'll tell you later. Let's keep looking for Joon Soo for now.

188
00:18:27,420 --> 00:18:33,950
Are you even worried about Joon Soo?

189
00:18:33,950 --> 00:18:36,250
Are you seriously saying that right now?

190
00:18:36,250 --> 00:18:39,280
Have you ever hugged Joon Soo?

191
00:18:40,910 --> 00:18:46,570
Do you even know that Joon Soo is our younger brother?

192
00:18:46,570 --> 00:18:49,940
Have you ever considered him your younger brother?

193
00:18:54,600 --> 00:18:59,990
Sometimes ... I really can't

194
00:19:01,580 --> 00:19:03,660
understand you.

195
00:20:19,890 --> 00:20:23,910
Sunshine Class - Goo Joon Soo

196
00:20:27,510 --> 00:20:31,040
Sunshine Class - Goo Joon Soo]

197
00:20:47,910 --> 00:20:50,540
Dad

198
00:20:53,150 --> 00:20:55,330
Dad

199
00:21:03,270 --> 00:21:06,480
[Dad, Mom, Little Noona, Me]

200
00:21:09,650 --> 00:21:13,540
[Dad, Mom, Little Noona, Me]

201
00:21:17,550 --> 00:21:19,840
Evil witch!

202
00:21:27,780 --> 00:21:32,300
Hong Joo Ga

203
00:21:36,210 --> 00:21:40,940
I've brought a memorandum promising not to touch the shares of Dae Seong True Winemakers,

204
00:21:40,940 --> 00:21:45,290
After you've given back the shares you've already gotten, contact me, Hyung.

205
00:21:45,290 --> 00:21:49,370
Then I'll give you the documents I have.

206
00:21:49,370 --> 00:21:55,100
I'll be waiting for you to contact me, Hyung. You know I can't wait long, right?

207
00:21:55,100 --> 00:21:57,350
I'll wait until tomorrow morning.

208
00:21:57,350 --> 00:22:02,590
I don't need any of that. You said you'll do it?

209
00:22:02,590 --> 00:22:07,280
Do it then. The day you cause chaos with those documents

210
00:22:07,280 --> 00:22:10,310
you know what will happen to Dad, right?

211
00:22:10,310 --> 00:22:13,290
Knowing that, you're still going to do it?

212
00:22:13,290 --> 00:22:15,470
You can't.

213
00:22:16,520 --> 00:22:21,330
Just watch whether I'll do it or not, Hyung.

214
00:22:21,330 --> 00:22:23,240
What?

215
00:22:23,240 --> 00:22:27,590
I will wait until tomorrow morning.

216
00:22:48,710 --> 00:22:52,030
Hey. What do you mean Joon Soo disappeared?

217
00:22:52,030 --> 00:22:53,880
What is that supposed to mean, guys?!

218
00:22:55,200 --> 00:22:56,420
What's that supposed to mean?!

219
00:22:56,420 --> 00:22:59,920
There are so many people in the house! How could you have not taken care of him properly?!

220
00:22:59,920 --> 00:23:01,750
Lower your voice, Mom.

221
00:23:01,750 --> 00:23:05,130
Did you search carefully?

222
00:23:05,130 --> 00:23:09,440
Have you tried looking? Have you searched properly?

223
00:23:14,690 --> 00:23:19,690
Have you looked everywhere? Have you tried looking everywhere possible?

224
00:23:22,780 --> 00:23:27,620
Are you back now?

225
00:23:28,530 --> 00:23:31,500
Are you back for good?

226
00:23:59,810 --> 00:24:01,770
Joon Soo!

227
00:24:03,200 --> 00:24:05,640
Joon Soo! Joon Soo, come here.

228
00:24:05,640 --> 00:24:09,800
- It's Mom. Mom's here.
- Mom!

229
00:24:11,110 --> 00:24:12,970
Joon Soo.

230
00:24:17,690 --> 00:24:21,470
Stop, stop. Mom's here. Stop crying.

231
00:24:21,470 --> 00:24:26,360
It's okay, Mom's here. Mom's here. Stop crying, stop.

232
00:24:26,360 --> 00:24:29,060
Oh my baby, my baby.

233
00:24:29,060 --> 00:24:31,420
Stop crying. Mom's here.

234
00:24:31,460 --> 00:24:33,930
It's okay, it's okay. Poor child.

235
00:25:11,520 --> 00:25:15,400
Close the door... Jeong Woo.

236
00:25:22,430 --> 00:25:30,560
Our fairytale ended at 5:20 p.m.

237
00:25:39,950 --> 00:25:45,030
Joon Soo. Why did you go in there?

238
00:25:49,450 --> 00:25:51,800
Why did you go under the desk, Joon Soo?

239
00:25:51,800 --> 00:25:54,270
Hide and seek.

240
00:25:56,030 --> 00:25:58,320
Hide and seek?

241
00:25:59,290 --> 00:26:04,090
With whom? Who were you playing hide and seek with?

242
00:26:12,340 --> 00:26:14,070
Joon Soo, who were you playing hide and seek with?

243
00:26:14,070 --> 00:26:17,040
Were you playing hide and seek with the kitchen grandmother?

244
00:26:19,120 --> 00:26:22,950
♪ Hide, hide carefully. I can see your hair! ♪

245
00:26:22,950 --> 00:26:27,430
♪ Hide, hide carefully. I can see your hair! ♪

246
00:26:27,430 --> 00:26:29,950
I'm going to look now!

247
00:27:00,100 --> 00:27:03,090
Joon Soo, you rascal! You rascal!

248
00:27:05,730 --> 00:27:07,660
You beautiful little rascal! You beautiful little rascal!

249
00:27:13,850 --> 00:27:18,150
♪ Hide carefully. I can see your hair! ♪

250
00:27:18,150 --> 00:27:23,530
♪ Hide carefully. I can see your hair! ♪

251
00:27:26,020 --> 00:27:31,890
♪ Hide carefully. I can see your hair! ♪

252
00:27:31,890 --> 00:27:37,300
♪ Hide carefully. I can see your hair! ♪

253
00:27:37,300 --> 00:27:42,590
♪ Hide carefully. I can see your hair! ♪

254
00:27:48,890 --> 00:27:51,190
You little rascal.

255
00:27:53,050 --> 00:27:55,180
Stay still. Stay still.

256
00:27:56,370 --> 00:28:00,620
Does this tickle? It tickles, doesn't it? You little rascal!

257
00:28:01,340 --> 00:28:03,990
You, you, you.

258
00:28:03,990 --> 00:28:07,100
Aigoo, that's enough.

259
00:28:07,130 --> 00:28:09,230
That's enough. That's enough.

260
00:28:12,030 --> 00:28:19,190
Aren't you sleepy? Sleep for a bit. Close your eyes.

261
00:28:21,290 --> 00:28:27,090
Aigoo. Such a good boy, you lovely brat.

262
00:28:27,090 --> 00:28:30,790
Aigoo, you, you, you, you, you naughty rascal.

263
00:28:30,790 --> 00:28:33,530
You, you, you, you, you naughty and beautiful rascal!

264
00:28:33,530 --> 00:28:36,530
You, you, you, you, you!

265
00:28:36,530 --> 00:28:39,860
You must have been bored all this time, haven't you?

266
00:28:44,440 --> 00:28:48,220
After you get a nice sleep like a good little boy...

267
00:28:48,220 --> 00:28:53,410
Mom will come and play with you all the time.

268
00:28:58,640 --> 00:29:04,270
Joon Soo, now

269
00:29:05,310 --> 00:29:12,550
you have to take care of Mom and your noona's for me.

270
00:29:15,650 --> 00:29:18,800
Now...

271
00:29:18,800 --> 00:29:24,430
you have to protect those pitiful women.

272
00:29:25,950 --> 00:29:28,820
Okay?

273
00:29:28,820 --> 00:29:30,910
Yes.

274
00:29:35,120 --> 00:29:39,340
Good boy.

275
00:29:40,500 --> 00:29:43,750
You stupid brat.

276
00:29:45,050 --> 00:29:51,640
Stupid brat... but you're still my good boy.

277
00:30:38,810 --> 00:30:41,150
What are you looking at just sitting there?

278
00:30:41,150 --> 00:30:45,350
Even if you have something to say, keep your mouths shut and go get some sleep.

279
00:30:45,370 --> 00:30:47,810
Because I have nothing to say.

280
00:30:47,810 --> 00:30:50,530
You really have nothing to say, Mom?

281
00:30:50,530 --> 00:30:51,990
Nothing.

282
00:30:51,990 --> 00:30:56,660
You really have nothing to say?

283
00:30:56,660 --> 00:31:01,600
I said I don't. Even if I did I wouldn't say it.

284
00:31:01,600 --> 00:31:05,050
I'm tired. I want to lie down, so you girls leave.

285
00:31:06,570 --> 00:31:08,640
I'm hungry.

286
00:31:14,110 --> 00:31:18,080
I'm so hungry that I could faint.

287
00:31:19,590 --> 00:31:23,610
Give me food. Please make me food.

288
00:31:50,900 --> 00:31:52,860
Did you know?

289
00:31:54,740 --> 00:31:58,300
Hyo Seon can't taste anything.

290
00:31:59,250 --> 00:32:03,520
Whether it's salty as sumac or bland as tofu,

291
00:32:03,520 --> 00:32:07,220
everything tastes the same to Hyo Seon.

292
00:32:08,800 --> 00:32:11,270
She's still like that?

293
00:32:12,650 --> 00:32:16,990
We took her to the hospital, but they couldn't find the reason.

294
00:32:19,220 --> 00:32:25,200
You're the one who caused it. What were you thinking?

295
00:32:25,200 --> 00:32:29,250
What were you thinking when you left, and what were you thinking when you came back?

296
00:32:29,250 --> 00:32:32,490
Are you going to leave again? You are, right?

297
00:32:32,490 --> 00:32:37,310
Did you come back because you think there's something worth taking?

298
00:32:37,310 --> 00:32:40,730
The food is ready. If Hyo Seon is sleeping, wake her up.

299
00:33:21,230 --> 00:33:24,300
Eat slowly. Slowly.

300
00:33:33,700 --> 00:33:37,270
No one's going to steal away your food so eat slowly.

301
00:33:39,350 --> 00:33:42,050
I said eat slowly!

302
00:33:53,540 --> 00:33:57,040
What are you doing? Drink water.

303
00:34:10,130 --> 00:34:15,610
Mom, we are completely broke now.

304
00:34:20,450 --> 00:34:24,650
We might even have to give up this house.

305
00:34:27,450 --> 00:34:29,170
What?

306
00:34:29,170 --> 00:34:34,480
It's possible that we might be left with nothing.

307
00:34:34,480 --> 00:34:39,170
I'm not sure what it means to be left with nothing,

308
00:34:39,170 --> 00:34:42,300
But Mom if we're left with nothing in this house,

309
00:34:44,470 --> 00:34:47,320
we won't be family anymore, right?

310
00:34:47,330 --> 00:34:49,490
What do you mean?

311
00:34:49,520 --> 00:34:53,690
What do you mean we're giving up this house? Why?

312
00:34:53,690 --> 00:34:56,360
I...

313
00:34:57,880 --> 00:35:00,930
What... are you going to do with me?

314
00:35:01,930 --> 00:35:05,000
I'd be good to know beforehand.

315
00:35:06,150 --> 00:35:09,930
That way I can ask for a loan.

316
00:35:09,930 --> 00:35:14,650
I can't die just because I'm left alone.

317
00:35:15,690 --> 00:35:20,100
Instead of disappearing without a word all of a sudden,

318
00:35:20,100 --> 00:35:25,700
can you warn me before you disappear again, Mom?

319
00:35:32,250 --> 00:35:37,200
I can't say these kinds of things, so ask Eun Jo.

320
00:35:37,230 --> 00:35:44,260
She's never heard me say anything sweet to her before, not even once.

321
00:35:44,260 --> 00:35:48,790
I couldn't do that at all to her, but I did it to you so much that it drove me crazy.

322
00:35:48,790 --> 00:35:53,730
As you already know, I felt like I could make a meal out of you,

323
00:35:54,900 --> 00:36:01,330
so I spoke with sugar in my mouth. Yes, I wasn't sincere.

324
00:36:01,360 --> 00:36:06,420
If I start talking to you sweetly right now, will you believe me?

325
00:36:06,420 --> 00:36:08,760
Will you believe me?

326
00:36:09,890 --> 00:36:12,530
Just keep eating.

327
00:36:13,210 --> 00:36:14,980
You eat too.

328
00:36:15,030 --> 00:36:20,140
And I don't know what she's talking about. Just ask her calmly.

329
00:36:20,140 --> 00:36:23,190
My head hurts so much that I can't ask her myself.

330
00:36:26,090 --> 00:36:28,400
But, you...

331
00:36:29,290 --> 00:36:33,140
Why does she speak so incoherently?

332
00:36:33,140 --> 00:36:37,510
What is she talking about? There's no beginning or end.

333
00:36:37,530 --> 00:36:41,590
If we need to give this house up because of whatever reason,

334
00:36:41,620 --> 00:36:45,550
then we could figure out how to stop it.

335
00:36:46,190 --> 00:36:49,670
She first asks if I'm going to abandon her?

336
00:36:51,970 --> 00:36:56,990
You should learn how to talk from Eun Jo.

337
00:37:00,130 --> 00:37:04,860
That's not the problem now though. It's this house.

338
00:37:04,880 --> 00:37:07,300
Give up this house?

339
00:37:07,300 --> 00:37:11,770
Do you think I'll watch this house fall into someone else's hands?

340
00:37:11,770 --> 00:37:16,790
I'm Song Kang Sook! We're definitely not giving it up.

341
00:37:16,830 --> 00:37:18,690
Keep that in mind and get back to your food.

342
00:37:18,690 --> 00:37:21,650
Chew carefully and slowly.

343
00:37:46,660 --> 00:37:51,750
Just because I was away from the house for a few days, you've let it get to this state?

344
00:37:51,770 --> 00:37:53,590
Look here, all of you.

345
00:37:53,600 --> 00:37:57,450
If you're going to do a half-hearted job and gloss things over just because the President is no longer here,

346
00:37:57,490 --> 00:37:59,320
pack your bags and leave this house immediately!

347
00:37:59,320 --> 00:38:04,390
Those who are not working hard or slacking, I've got my eye on you already.

348
00:38:04,390 --> 00:38:07,470
Did you think I wouldn't know who was being lazy?

349
00:38:13,610 --> 00:38:15,930
Look here, Hyo Seon's Uncle!

350
00:38:18,260 --> 00:38:23,690
Why are you here at this time? Why are you at home leaving the winery empty?

351
00:38:23,690 --> 00:38:27,060
If you're lazy, it won't matter if you're her uncle or the dog's uncle, I'll kick you out right away.

352
00:38:27,060 --> 00:38:29,330
Get back to work immediately!

353
00:38:41,190 --> 00:38:43,980
Hey, are you going to wear that?

354
00:38:45,560 --> 00:38:48,140
Why? I shouldn't?

355
00:38:48,140 --> 00:38:51,890
If you dress so plainly, avoid going with me. I'll be the one more embarrassed.

356
00:38:53,000 --> 00:38:55,330
This won't do. Move aside and let me see.

357
00:38:57,460 --> 00:39:00,770
But, why are you doing this? Where are we going?

358
00:39:00,770 --> 00:39:06,460
Hey you, all of these clothes... Give some of these clothes to Eun Jo.

359
00:39:06,460 --> 00:39:09,070
You always wear such pretty and expensive clothes.

360
00:39:09,070 --> 00:39:12,320
Don't you feel bad to see the way Eun Jo dresses?

361
00:39:15,420 --> 00:39:20,770
This one, this one and also this one...

362
00:39:20,770 --> 00:39:24,910
And this. Give all these ones to Eun Jo.

363
00:39:26,990 --> 00:39:28,980
What are you looking at?

364
00:39:28,980 --> 00:39:33,400
I'm your stepmother. I'm doing this because I'm trying to act like your stepmother.

365
00:39:37,170 --> 00:39:40,280
What... What did you say?

366
00:39:40,280 --> 00:39:44,100
Take that off and put this on. This matches your skin tone.

367
00:39:49,370 --> 00:39:52,880
T- trying to act like my stepmother?

368
00:40:09,790 --> 00:40:13,350
You know, I thought this over.

369
00:40:13,350 --> 00:40:18,350
Whether or not you agree with me, like me or hate me...

370
00:40:18,350 --> 00:40:20,870
none of it matters.

371
00:40:20,870 --> 00:40:26,920
I really can't tell a lie, even if I died and came back to life.

372
00:40:26,920 --> 00:40:31,200
And speaking sugary words

373
00:40:31,200 --> 00:40:35,030
I can't do that anymore either.

374
00:40:35,050 --> 00:40:37,160
Hyo Seon.

375
00:40:37,160 --> 00:40:46,380
If I have to think of you the same way I think of Eun Jo or Joon Soo,

376
00:40:46,420 --> 00:40:50,040
my insides would explode and I would die.

377
00:40:50,040 --> 00:40:53,350
Do you understand what I'm saying?

378
00:40:53,350 --> 00:40:58,910
How can you be the same as Eun Jo or Joon Soo?

379
00:40:58,960 --> 00:41:04,420
When I didn't even give birth to you. You know that much, right?

380
00:41:09,190 --> 00:41:11,730
Of course you're different.

381
00:41:11,730 --> 00:41:15,580
If Eun Jo or Joon Soo got an illness,

382
00:41:15,580 --> 00:41:18,650
it'd hurt like I lost a part of me inside.

383
00:41:20,400 --> 00:41:25,760
If you got sick, it wouldn't hurt like that.

384
00:41:27,580 --> 00:41:32,800
Even though it wouldn't feel like I lost a part of me,

385
00:41:32,800 --> 00:41:37,640
it would at least hurt like I got cut by a knife.

386
00:41:37,640 --> 00:41:41,210
Somehow, I've been trying to live my life...

387
00:41:43,240 --> 00:41:48,080
But, there's no one else who reminds me of your father more than you do. You're the only one.

388
00:41:49,640 --> 00:41:56,120
Let's live like that. I'm your stepmother, and you're my stepdaughter.

389
00:41:58,130 --> 00:42:03,190
If you keep that much in mind, you won't hope for anything more.

390
00:42:04,760 --> 00:42:09,060
If there was nothing more you hope for, why would the two of us need to fight like wild dogs?

391
00:42:10,320 --> 00:42:12,070
Isn't that so?

392
00:42:13,960 --> 00:42:17,080
If I'm wrong in what I said, tell me so.

393
00:42:20,180 --> 00:42:29,360
Do you really mean what you said about hurting and bleeding like getting cut by a knife?

394
00:42:30,680 --> 00:42:32,440
That's right.

395
00:42:34,360 --> 00:42:39,380
Do I really mean that much to you?

396
00:42:40,980 --> 00:42:43,380
Yes, you do.

397
00:42:43,380 --> 00:42:46,070
We don't have time so hurry up and change your clothes.

398
00:42:46,070 --> 00:42:48,470
As time goes by...

399
00:42:49,920 --> 00:42:53,600
Even if it takes a little more time..

400
00:42:53,600 --> 00:42:57,370
When I'm also sick,

401
00:42:57,370 --> 00:43:00,630
will you feel like you lost a part of you inside?

402
00:43:00,650 --> 00:43:06,140
Hey, to that extent, that's considered a threat.

403
00:43:06,160 --> 00:43:10,020
Would you like it if I put sugar in mouth to say sweet lies to you?

404
00:43:10,020 --> 00:43:12,520
Even if not to the point of feeling like you lost a part of you,

405
00:43:12,520 --> 00:43:21,000
Then... Even so, do you think it would hurt you like something similar?

406
00:43:24,950 --> 00:43:28,970
Do you think it will hurt you in a similar way?

407
00:43:28,970 --> 00:43:33,650
Well, that depends on how you behave.

408
00:43:34,630 --> 00:43:36,110
You're not going to change?

409
00:43:36,110 --> 00:43:41,600
If it depends on me, if I am good,

410
00:43:41,600 --> 00:43:46,960
will it hurt you in a similar way? Will it?

411
00:43:46,960 --> 00:43:52,290
Hey, why are you trying to see me hurt, anyway?

412
00:43:52,290 --> 00:43:55,420
What else in the world am I supposed to say now?!

413
00:43:59,610 --> 00:44:03,470
- Why are you being so bothersome?!
- Mom...

414
00:44:04,640 --> 00:44:11,790
Don't forget that you owe me.

415
00:44:15,270 --> 00:44:25,080
Don't forget about the sins you committed against me and Dad.

416
00:44:28,280 --> 00:44:32,670
I'm not going to ask you to make it up to me some other way.

417
00:44:37,800 --> 00:44:46,780
So please hurt for me in a similar way like you do for Unni, Mom.

418
00:44:55,540 --> 00:45:00,790
Song Eun Jo is forever Han Jeong Woo's woman

419
00:45:09,220 --> 00:45:16,070
♫ Leaving behind the time ♫

420
00:45:16,070 --> 00:45:18,150
I can't let you go alone!

421
00:45:18,150 --> 00:45:22,510
Noona, you're... my woman. I love you! I love you!

422
00:45:22,510 --> 00:45:28,930
♫ and I waited for you ♫

423
00:45:28,930 --> 00:45:31,050
You don't know me?

424
00:45:33,820 --> 00:45:37,280
Noona, no matter where you are or how you're living,

425
00:45:37,280 --> 00:45:41,470
I'm going to find you and take care of you.

426
00:45:41,470 --> 00:45:43,600
Just trust in me!

427
00:45:44,430 --> 00:45:50,550
♫ Looking only in this direction, my two eyes ♫

428
00:45:51,870 --> 00:45:58,020
♫ can't say they waited for you ♫

429
00:45:58,020 --> 00:46:04,200
♫ I can't say I'm coming back ♫

430
00:46:04,200 --> 00:46:07,630
- Santa Lucia-
- Hey, stop that.

431
00:46:10,220 --> 00:46:13,010
♫ who cannot forget you ♫

432
00:46:13,010 --> 00:46:15,840
- O sole mio...
- You...

433
00:46:15,840 --> 00:46:21,460
♫ If there are tens of thousand who will just love you ♫

434
00:46:21,460 --> 00:46:27,100
♫ If I can always look at you ♫

435
00:46:27,100 --> 00:46:32,220
♫ The day I return to your side again ♫

436
00:46:32,220 --> 00:46:36,080
♫ will come again ♫

437
00:46:38,270 --> 00:46:45,210
♫ The day I return to your side again ♫

438
00:46:55,230 --> 00:46:57,620
Noona. I have something to say to you.

439
00:46:57,620 --> 00:47:00,560
Jeong Woo, not right now. Later.

440
00:47:00,560 --> 00:47:05,000
I can't wait. It has to be now.

441
00:47:07,700 --> 00:47:11,680
Song Eun Jo is forever Han Jeong Woo's woman

442
00:47:25,980 --> 00:47:30,280
I know what you're going to say.

443
00:47:30,280 --> 00:47:31,900
What are you talking about?

444
00:47:31,900 --> 00:47:36,580
I'm definitely going to be rejected. I know that already.

445
00:47:36,580 --> 00:47:40,170
Even so, I'm going to do it.

446
00:47:41,530 --> 00:47:45,220
No matter how you respond, I'm still going to ask you.

447
00:47:50,770 --> 00:47:54,720
Since you were 14 years old, you've been my woman.

448
00:47:54,730 --> 00:47:57,290
I'm not going to cause tears to fall from your eyes.

449
00:47:57,290 --> 00:47:59,970
I'm not going to let you go hungry for food.

450
00:47:59,970 --> 00:48:04,470
And whatever you wanted to be, I would make it happen for you.

451
00:48:04,470 --> 00:48:10,460
Not another man, but I... wanted to be the one to do all this for you in order to win your heart.

452
00:48:10,480 --> 00:48:11,210
Jeong Woo.

453
00:48:11,210 --> 00:48:15,360
I can't watch you rotting here anymore.

454
00:48:15,380 --> 00:48:18,320
If you were living your life here smiling,

455
00:48:18,320 --> 00:48:21,240
if you were in a loving relationship with Hong Gi Hoon

456
00:48:21,240 --> 00:48:23,680
then what could I say?

457
00:48:24,580 --> 00:48:31,230
That Hong Gi Hoon has only made you cry. It'll be like that in the future too.

458
00:48:31,230 --> 00:48:33,890
I cannot stand to see that.

459
00:48:33,890 --> 00:48:36,900
- Jeong Woo.
-Live with me.

460
00:48:36,900 --> 00:48:39,690
- Jeong Woo.
- Live with me.

461
00:48:39,690 --> 00:48:44,100
Live with me. Live with me, you brat!

462
00:48:45,790 --> 00:48:49,300
I'll make you happy.

463
00:48:49,300 --> 00:48:55,010
I'll live having only eyes for you for the rest of my life. I'll live for you.

464
00:48:55,010 --> 00:48:59,370
As long as I have you, I can do anything.

465
00:49:04,670 --> 00:49:06,580
Jeong Woo.

466
00:49:08,910 --> 00:49:15,310
Jeong Woo, I... like that person.

467
00:49:17,590 --> 00:49:20,740
It's not because I don't like you,

468
00:49:20,740 --> 00:49:25,710
but it's because I like that person too much, so I can't live with you.

469
00:49:28,220 --> 00:49:33,380
I'm not even sure whether I can spend my life with that person,

470
00:49:33,380 --> 00:49:39,230
but even if I can't...

471
00:49:39,230 --> 00:49:45,220
Even if we are not meant to be together forever...

472
00:49:47,020 --> 00:49:49,900
I wonder if that even matters.

473
00:49:51,260 --> 00:49:57,840
What does it matter? When I love him to death.

474
00:50:03,990 --> 00:50:10,000
A girl who likes you just as much as I like that person

475
00:50:10,000 --> 00:50:12,180
will definitely appear.

476
00:50:13,900 --> 00:50:16,560
It'll definitely happen, Jeong Woo.

477
00:50:17,930 --> 00:50:22,300
Because you're a good kid.

478
00:50:27,900 --> 00:50:33,650
I have to go to that person right now.

479
00:50:33,650 --> 00:50:39,850
That person might lose his father.

480
00:50:57,970 --> 00:51:05,510
I care for you. You're so lovely.

481
00:51:06,800 --> 00:51:11,760
Because you're by my side, I feel safe, Jeong Woo.

482
00:52:18,510 --> 00:52:20,270
Eun Jo.

483
00:52:47,340 --> 00:52:49,170
Incoming call
...

484
00:52:51,310 --> 00:52:52,960
Hello?

485
00:52:52,960 --> 00:52:55,850
Stop right there. Don't take another step.

486
00:52:55,860 --> 00:52:56,790
Where are you?

487
00:52:56,820 --> 00:52:59,250
Stop right there! Right where you are!

488
00:53:00,560 --> 00:53:03,300
Eun Jo. Don't do this.

489
00:53:03,300 --> 00:53:06,780
It'll be over soon. It'll be over very soon.

490
00:53:06,800 --> 00:53:09,110
- It's already over.
- What do you mean?

491
00:53:09,150 --> 00:53:12,460
I ran here because I thought you might be doing more useless negotiations.

492
00:53:12,460 --> 00:53:15,920
What do you mean it's over?

493
00:53:15,920 --> 00:53:22,480
The prosecutors' office have laid charges against Hong Joo Ga and Chairman Hong Han Seok.

494
00:53:24,570 --> 00:53:26,500
What did you say?

495
00:53:42,020 --> 00:53:46,540
Good job. You won.

496
00:53:57,510 --> 00:54:03,670
Do you know Park Ki Man, Hong Joo Ga's former Headquarters Director?

497
00:54:03,670 --> 00:54:06,690
He reported Hong Joo Ga and Chairman Hong to the prosecutors' office

498
00:54:06,690 --> 00:54:11,520
and made a declaration of conscience this morning.

499
00:54:11,520 --> 00:54:16,680
You should've picked up your phone! You should've discussed it with me. Why are you doing things alone?

500
00:54:19,790 --> 00:54:25,360
It seems he needs to report to the prosecutors' office. Are you sure you don't want to go see him?

501
00:55:20,840 --> 00:55:25,200
Open the window for a moment. Open the window for a moment, please!

502
00:55:32,700 --> 00:55:35,270
I'll ask you this, one more time.

503
00:55:38,250 --> 00:55:43,110
Can't you just give everything up?

504
00:55:43,110 --> 00:55:47,360
Just give everything up and free yourself.

505
00:55:48,640 --> 00:55:54,870
I'll take care of you. I'll earn money with my own hands

506
00:55:55,920 --> 00:55:58,980
and support you financially.

507
00:56:01,040 --> 00:56:07,900
We'll play Go together and go fishing.

508
00:56:12,770 --> 00:56:15,690
I'll be a good son to you.

509
00:56:16,860 --> 00:56:20,690
Please give everything up and emerge from all this, Father.

510
00:56:32,960 --> 00:56:34,860
Let's go.

511
00:57:28,490 --> 00:57:31,440
Nan Hee!

512
00:57:31,440 --> 00:57:33,700
Hyo Seon!

513
00:57:33,700 --> 00:57:36,050
You remember my mom, right?

514
00:57:36,050 --> 00:57:37,710
Hello.

515
00:57:37,710 --> 00:57:42,380
We need hiking outfits for a group. Can you show us?

516
00:57:42,380 --> 00:57:46,810
A group? Of course. This way please.

517
00:58:00,490 --> 00:58:02,710
Who is it for?

518
00:58:02,710 --> 00:58:06,700
Who else? I'm buying it for Eun Jo. Why?

519
00:58:08,370 --> 00:58:13,170
Don't play favorites. I'm also Dad's daughter.

520
00:58:17,130 --> 00:58:19,790
We'll take this too.

521
00:58:19,790 --> 00:58:21,420
It's pretty, right?

522
01:01:20,890 --> 01:01:26,150
From the start, this wasn't supposed to happen.

523
01:01:28,900 --> 01:01:33,820
You should've told me right from the start.

524
01:01:37,690 --> 01:01:43,080
Things would've been better if you had told me when you were suffering.

525
01:01:46,430 --> 01:01:52,400
If we discussed things together nicely,

526
01:01:53,890 --> 01:01:59,690
maybe neither of us

527
01:02:01,230 --> 01:02:04,200
would've had to lose anything.

528
01:02:07,410 --> 01:02:09,960
Why did you do that?

529
01:02:12,040 --> 01:02:14,270
You shouldn't have.

530
01:02:18,350 --> 01:02:25,890
You can rely on me. When Dad said this to me,

531
01:02:28,310 --> 01:02:32,200
although I didn't have any expectations right away,

532
01:02:34,140 --> 01:02:38,230
at least I knew there was someone I could rely on one day.

533
01:02:40,030 --> 01:02:41,960
At that time,

534
01:02:43,970 --> 01:02:48,380
I felt the part of me that was tightly bound together

535
01:02:49,930 --> 01:02:52,620
slowly opening up.

536
01:02:55,660 --> 01:02:58,210
Lean on me.

537
01:03:02,020 --> 01:03:04,590
You can lean on me.

538
01:03:08,270 --> 01:03:13,880
This time, you can lean on me.

539
01:03:14,860 --> 01:03:16,440
Okay?

540
01:03:28,710 --> 01:03:35,530
♫ Again today my memory led me astray ♫

541
01:03:35,530 --> 01:03:40,400
♫ I who am strolling at the end of the street ♫

542
01:03:42,600 --> 01:03:49,940
♫ where you can't hold me again ♫

543
01:03:49,940 --> 01:03:55,250
♫ I ask again about the way ♫

544
01:03:55,250 --> 01:04:04,250
♫ While looking at heaven I'm praying ♫

545
01:04:04,250 --> 01:04:10,230
While looking at heaven I'm praying

546
01:04:10,230 --> 01:04:13,860
♫ It must be you ♫

547
01:04:13,860 --> 01:04:17,610
♫ I can't do without you ♫

548
01:04:17,610 --> 01:04:24,510
♫ Like this for another day, month or year ♫

549
01:04:24,510 --> 01:04:28,170
♫ I don't mind even if I am hurt ♫

550
01:04:28,170 --> 01:04:32,100
♫ I don't mind even if my heart breaks ♫

551
01:04:32,100 --> 01:04:38,330
♫ because, yes, you are the only one I love. ♫

552
01:04:38,330 --> 01:04:41,920
♫ My bruised heart ♫

553
01:04:41,920 --> 01:04:45,410
♫ is shouting so that ♫

554
01:04:45,410 --> 01:04:50,860
♫ I can find you ♫

555
01:04:50,890 --> 01:04:54,380
♫ Wherever you are ♫

556
01:04:54,380 --> 01:05:00,350
♫ Can't you hear my voice? ♫

557
01:05:00,350 --> 01:05:04,440
♫ Come to me ♫

558
01:05:04,460 --> 01:05:07,500
♫ Even if I live again ♫

559
01:05:07,500 --> 01:05:11,670
♫ No matter how many times I am reborn ♫

560
01:05:11,710 --> 01:05:18,540
♫ There isn't a day that I can live without you. ♫

561
01:05:18,550 --> 01:05:21,820
♫ The love I will protect ♫

562
01:05:21,830 --> 01:05:23,530
♫ The love I love ♫

563
01:05:23,530 --> 01:05:26,850
I was always afraid of the things I had to deal with.

564
01:05:26,850 --> 01:05:30,110
Now, I'm not afraid of anything.

565
01:05:30,110 --> 01:05:33,690
I can't believe you. What are you guys plotting?

566
01:05:33,700 --> 01:05:36,770
I'm coming to you now, my stupid brat.

567
01:05:36,770 --> 01:05:37,520
Song Eun Jo is forever Han Jeong Woo's woman

568
01:05:38,540 --> 01:05:42,610
No matter where you are, I'll be with you. You know that, right?.

569
01:05:42,610 --> 01:05:45,820
I could just leave like that.

570
01:05:45,820 --> 01:05:50,490
Unni abandoned me and left.
